#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:2
msgid "Deployment Guide"
msgstr "部署指南"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:4
msgid ""
"This page covers deploying LMCache multiprocess mode in Docker and "
"Kubernetes environments, along with production best practices."
msgstr "本页介绍如何在 Docker 和 Kubernetes 环境中部署 LMCache 多进程模式，并提供生产环境的最佳实践建议。"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:12
msgid "Docker"
msgstr "Docker"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:14
msgid "**LMCache container:**"
msgstr "**LMCache 容器：**"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:25
msgid "**vLLM container:**"
msgstr "**vLLM 容器：**"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:37
msgid "Required Docker flags:"
msgstr "所需的 Docker 标志："

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:39
msgid ""
"``--network host`` -- Allows the vLLM container to reach LMCache on "
"localhost."
msgstr "``--network host`` -- 允许 vLLM 容器访问本地主机上的 LMCache。"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:40
msgid ""
"``--ipc host`` -- Required for CUDA IPC shared memory transfers between "
"containers in the default (legacy) mode; see *Isolated IPC* below for "
"running without it."
msgstr "``--ipc host`` -- 在默认（遗留）模式下，容器之间进行 CUDA IPC 共享内存传输所需；有关不使用它的运行方式，请参见下面的 *Isolated IPC*。"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:43
msgid ""
"``--runtime nvidia --gpus all`` -- GPU access via the NVIDIA container "
"runtime."
msgstr "``--runtime nvidia --gpus all`` -- 通过 NVIDIA 容器运行时访问 GPU。"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:46
msgid "**HTTP server variant:**"
msgstr "**HTTP 服务器变体：**"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:48
msgid ""
"For health-check and cache management API support (useful with container "
"orchestrators), use the HTTP server entry point:"
msgstr "对于健康检查和缓存管理 API 支持（在容器编排器中非常有用），请使用 HTTP 服务器入口点："

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:61
msgid "Isolated IPC (running without ``--ipc host``)"
msgstr "隔离的 IPC（在不使用 ``--ipc host`` 的情况下运行）"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:63
msgid ""
"CUDA IPC in MP mode has two legs, and by default both depend on a shared "
"``/dev/shm`` tmpfs -- which is what ``--ipc host`` / ``hostIPC: true`` "
"really provides:"
msgstr "CUDA IPC 在 MP 模式下有两个部分，默认情况下这两个部分都依赖于共享的 ``/dev/shm`` tmpfs -- 这正是 ``--ipc host`` / ``hostIPC: true`` 实际提供的内容："

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:67
msgid ""
"**KV-cache memory sharing**: the default registration path uses PyTorch "
"storage IPC, which keeps a reference-counter file in ``/dev/shm``."
msgstr "**KV-Cache 内存共享**：默认注册路径使用 PyTorch 存储 IPC，它在 ``/dev/shm`` 中保持一个引用计数文件。"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:70
msgid ""
"**Event ordering** (the per-STORE/RETRIEVE device events): CUDA "
"interprocess *event* handles only resolve when both containers share a "
"``/dev/shm`` tmpfs."
msgstr "**事件排序**（每个 STORE/RETRIEVE 设备事件）：CUDA 进程间 *事件* 句柄仅在两个容器共享 ``/dev/shm`` tmpfs 时解析。"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:74
msgid ""
"The **isolated IPC** setting removes both: KV-cache registration switches"
" to raw CUDA IPC memory handles "
"(``docs/design/v1/platform/devices/cuda/ipc_wrapper.md``) and event "
"ordering to timeline-semaphore events carried over CUDA IPC memory "
"handles "
"(``docs/design/v1/platform/devices/cuda/timeline_semaphore_event_ipc.md``)."
" Both rendezvous in the kernel driver, so they work across containers "
"that share nothing -- no host IPC namespace, no common ``/dev/shm``, no "
"``--ipc host``. It must be enabled on **both** sides of a deployment:"
msgstr "**隔离的 IPC** 设置移除了两者：KV Cache 注册切换到原始 CUDA IPC 内存句柄 (``docs/design/v1/platform/devices/cuda/ipc_wrapper.md``)，事件排序切换到通过 CUDA IPC 内存句柄传递的时间线信号量事件 (``docs/design/v1/platform/devices/cuda/timeline_semaphore_event_ipc.md``)。两者在内核驱动程序中汇合，因此它们可以在没有共享任何内容的容器之间工作——没有主机 IPC 命名空间，没有公共的 ``/dev/shm``，没有 ``--ipc host``。它必须在部署的 **两侧** 启用："

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:94
msgid ""
"The two event mechanisms exchange incompatible handles, so a half-enabled"
" deployment fails loudly at event import (the vLLM side crashes "
"immediately; the server side logs the error and the worker times out "
"after ``lmcache.mp.mq_timeout``)."
msgstr "这两种事件机制交换不兼容的句柄，因此半启用的部署在事件导入时会出现严重故障（vLLM 端立即崩溃；服务器端记录错误，工作进程在 ``lmcache.mp.mq_timeout`` 后超时）。"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:100
msgid ""
"With isolated IPC enabled on both sides, the MP data path has no "
"``/dev/shm`` dependency left: ``--ipc host`` (Docker) and ``hostIPC: "
"true`` / the shared ``/dev/shm`` mount (Kubernetes) can be dropped. The "
"two containers only need access to the same GPUs and distinct PID "
"*values* (any regular container setup provides both). The Kubernetes "
":doc:`operator` wires isolated IPC by default on NVIDIA "
"(``spec.isolatedIPC``)."
msgstr "在两侧启用隔离 IPC 后，MP 数据路径不再依赖 ``/dev/shm``：可以去掉 ``--ipc host``（Docker）和 ``hostIPC: true`` / 共享的 ``/dev/shm`` 挂载（Kubernetes）。这两个容器只需要访问相同的 GPU 和不同的 PID *值*（任何常规容器设置都提供这两者）。Kubernetes :doc:`operator` 默认在 NVIDIA 上连接隔离 IPC（``spec.isolatedIPC``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:108
msgid "Current limitations:"
msgstr "当前限制："

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:110
msgid ""
"Supported by the **vLLM MP connector only**. SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, "
"CacheBlend, and qstore still create raw CUDA interprocess events and "
"require isolated IPC to stay off (the default)."
msgstr "仅由 **vLLM MP 连接器** 支持。SGLang、TensorRT-LLM、CacheBlend 和 qstore 仍然创建原始的 CUDA 进程间事件，并需要隔离的 IPC 处于关闭状态（默认）。"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:113
msgid ""
"KV-cache tensors must live in ``cudaMalloc``-style memory. CUDA VMM "
"allocations have no IPC memory handle, so "
"``PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True`` and vLLM's sleep "
"mode (``CuMemAllocator``) are incompatible with isolated IPC; "
"registration fails with an explanatory error."
msgstr "KV-cache 张量必须位于 ``cudaMalloc`` 风格的内存中。CUDA VMM 分配没有 IPC 内存句柄，因此 ``PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True`` 和 vLLM 的休眠模式 (``CuMemAllocator``) 与隔离 IPC 不兼容；注册失败并显示解释性错误。"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:118
msgid ""
"Requires the ``cuda-python`` package on both sides (included in the CUDA "
"requirement files)."
msgstr "在两侧都需要 ``cuda-python`` 包（包含在 CUDA 需求文件中）。"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:122
msgid "Kubernetes"
msgstr "Kubernetes"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:124
msgid ""
"LMCache is designed for a **DaemonSet + Deployment** pattern: one LMCache"
" server per node (DaemonSet) shared by multiple vLLM pods (Deployment)."
msgstr ""
"LMCache 设计为 **DaemonSet + Deployment** 模式：每个节点一个 LMCache "
"服务器（DaemonSet），由多个 vLLM pod（Deployment）共享。"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:127
msgid "Example YAML files are provided in ``examples/multi_process/``."
msgstr "在 ``examples/multi_process/`` 中提供了示例 YAML 文件。"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:130
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:132
msgid "Kubernetes cluster with GPU support (NVIDIA GPU Operator installed)"
msgstr "支持 GPU 的 Kubernetes 集群（安装了 NVIDIA GPU Operator）"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:133
msgid "At least 4 GPUs per node"
msgstr "每个节点至少需要 4 个 GPU"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:134
msgid "``kubectl`` configured to access your cluster"
msgstr "``kubectl`` 配置为访问您的集群"

#: ../../source/mp/deployment.rst:136
msgid ""
"Classic GPU Operator installs register RuntimeClass ``nvidia``. CDI+NRI "
"installs often have no RuntimeClass objects. On those clusters omit "
"``runtimeClassName`` on the LMCache DaemonSet and request a management "
"CDI device (see *GPU Operator NRI/CDI* below). The operator path is :ref"
":`mp-operator-nri-cdi`."
msgstr "经典 GPU Operator 安装注册运行时类 ``nvidia``。CDI+NRI 安装通常没有运行时类对象。在这些集群上，省略 LMCache DaemonSet 上的 ``runtimeClassName`` 并请求管理 CDI 设备（请参见下面的 *GPU Operator NRI/CDI*）。操作员路径为 :ref:`mp-operator-nri-cdi`。"

